8690 0 obj
<< /Subtype /application#2Fx-tex/Type /EmbeddedFile /Params<</ModDate (D:20260910) >> /Length 211 >>        
stream
\begin {equation*}s_a \partial \left ( e_{i_1} \wedge \cdots \wedge e_{i_t} \right ) + \partial s_a \left ( e_{i_1} \wedge \cdots \wedge e_{i_t} \right ) = a e_{i_1} \wedge \cdots \wedge e_{i_t}.\end {equation*}
endstream
endobj
8691 0 obj
<< /Type /Filespec /AFRelationship /Source /Desc (TeX source) /F (tag-AFfile523.tex) /UF <FEFF007400610067002D0041004600660069006C0065003500320033002E007400650078> /EF<</F 8690 0 R/UF 8690 0 R>> >>
